1
00:00:00,430 --> 00:00:02,450
(Raj:)and pulled and pulled.

2
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:05,260
(Leonard:)You do what you want,

3
00:00:05,270 --> 00:00:07,230
(Leonard:)I'm not touching another
man's honey tree.

4
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:10,520
(Raj:)All right, uh,
forget pulling.

5
00:00:10,520 --> 00:00:12,910
(Raj:)How about we get
an electric saw and cut it off?

6
00:00:12,910 --> 00:00:14,770
What?! No saws!

7
00:00:14,780 --> 00:00:17,980
(Howard:)One circumcision was enough.

8
00:00:20,150 --> 00:00:22,000
(Leonard:)How about an
acetylene torch?

9
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,330
(Howard:)Okay, I can't believe
this needs to be said out loud.

10
00:00:24,330 --> 00:00:25,790
(Howard:)No pulling, no saws, no torches.

11
00:00:25,790 --> 00:00:27,750
(Leonard:)Well, then what do
you want us to do?

12
00:00:27,760 --> 00:00:30,520
MRS. WOLOWITZ
Howard, I made cookies for you

13
00:00:30,520 --> 00:00:33,210
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)and your little friends!

14
00:00:33,210 --> 00:00:35,510
(Howard:)That's great, Mom, thanks!

15
00:00:35,510 --> 00:00:38,380
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)I'll bring them up
with some Hawaiian Punch!

16
00:00:38,380 --> 00:00:39,830
(Howard:)Don't come up here!

17
00:00:39,830 --> 00:00:42,940
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)Why not?! Are you
ashamed of your mother?!

18
00:00:42,940 --> 00:00:45,440
(Howard:)Yes, but that's not the point!

19
00:00:45,440 --> 00:00:47,470
(Howard:)Get me out of here.

20
00:00:47,470 --> 00:00:49,340
(Leonard:)You have any ideas, Raj?

21
00:00:49,340 --> 00:00:59,020
(Raj:)Right now, all I can think about
is cookies and Hawaiian Punch.

